      },
      {
        "target" : "Tự động chia sẻ cho phép “%@” đọc các hồ sơ mới khi chúng có sẵn. Bạn có thể quản lý quyền truy cập trong Sức khỏe.",
        "filename" : "HealthRecordsPlugin-Localizable.loctable",
        "language" : "vi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "ऑटोमैटिक शेयरिंग “%@” को उपलब्ध होने के साथ नए रिकॉर्ड पढ़ने की अनुमति देता है। आप सेहत में जाकर ऐक्सेस को प्रबंधित कर सकते हैं।",
        "filename" : "HealthRecordsPlugin-Localizable.loctable",
        "language" : "hi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Automatsko dijeljenje omogućava aplikaciji “%@” čitanje novih zapisa čim budu dostupni. Pristupom možete upravljati u aplikaciji Zdravlje.",
        "filename" : "HealthRecordsPlugin-Localizable.loctable",
        "language" : "hr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "การแชร์อัตโนมัติอนุญาตให้ “%@” อ่านบันทึกใหม่เมื่อมีให้ใช้งานได้ คุณสามารถจัดการการเข้าถึงในแอปสุขภาพได้",
        "filename" : "HealthRecordsPlugin-Localizable.loctable",
        "language" : "th"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Automatic sharing allows “%@” to read new records as they become available. You can manage access in Health.",
